\n      justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n    .card:hover {\n      background: rgba(231, 200, 120, 0.12);\n      border-color: #E7C878;\n      transform: translateY(-3px);\n    }\n    .card-title {\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: #f8fafc;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .card-desc {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      color: #94a3b8;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n      margin-bottom: 14px;\n    }\n    .badge {\n      display: inline-block;\n      align-self: flex-start;\n      padding: 4px 10px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      background: rgba(231, 200, 120, 0.2);\n      color: #E7C878;\n      border: 1px solid #E7C878;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <h1>🌐 PORTAL DE REDES INTERACTIVAS</h1>\n    <p>Selecciona la red que deseas visualizar:</p>\n\n    <div class=\"grid\">\n      <!-- Card 1 -->\n      <a href=\"kennedy_radial.html\" class=\"card\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"card-title\">🚥 Red Radial Kennedy (Burbujas / Infografía)</div>\n          <div class=\"card-desc\">Ecosistema radial de esferas e infografía adaptado a Kennedy - Corabastos - Zona Franca con toggle Claro/OLED.</div>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"badge\">Abrir Red Radial Kennedy →</span>\n      </a>\n\n      <!-- Card 2 -->\n      <a href=\"red_congestion_matrioshka.html\" class=\"card\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"card-title\">📦 Red Causal Matrioshka Kennedy (Tarjetas 3D)</div>\n          <div class=\"card-desc\">Red estática con tarjetas rectangulares y tríadas de Síntoma ➔ Causa ➔ Efecto interconectadas en malla.</div>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"badge\">Abrir Red Matrioshka →</span>\n      </a>\n\n      <!-- Card 3 -->\n      <a href=\"valparaiso.html\" class=\"card\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"card-title\">🏛️ Red Actores del Turismo en Valparaíso</div>\n          <div class=\"card-desc\">Red estática Matrioshka adaptada a los actores y dinámicas territoriales de Valparaíso.</div>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"badge\">Abrir Red Valparaíso →</span>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Creación de index.html para evitar errores 404 en el dominio raíz de GitHub Pages.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\aleja\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\d3de736b-bad3-4cd4-b3f7-8b59f3dfee52\\index.html","toolAction":"Creating index.html portal file","toolSummary":"Create index.html file"}}]}
